      {
        "id": "JinxQ",
        "name": "Switcheroo!",
        "description": "Jinx modifies her basic attacks by swapping between Pow-Pow, her minigun and Fishbones, her rocket launcher. Attacks with Pow-Pow grant Attack Speed, while attacks with Fishbones deal area of effect damage, gain increased range, but drain Mana and attack slower.",
        "tooltip": "Jinx swaps weapons between Fishbones the rocket launcher and Pow-Pow the minigun.<br /><br />While using the rocket launcher, Jinx's Attacks deal <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(110% Attack Damage) physical damage</span> to the target and nearby enemies, gain 100/125/150/175/200 range, cost Mana, and scale 10% less with bonus Attack Speed.<br /><br />While using the minigun, Jinx's Attacks grant <span>Attack Speed</span> for 2.5 seconds, stacking up to 3 times (<span> + 30/55/80/105/130% max</span>).<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Minigun stacks fall off one at a time and only benefit Jinx's first Attack after switching to the rocket launcher.</span>",
